## 3dxdisp
https://github.com/jtsiomb/3dxdisp
Copyright (c) Ioannis Tsiombikas
License: GNU General Public License v2
The LCD HID protocol (report IDs 0x0C, 0x0D, 0x12, page/column addressing,
bit order) was reverse-engineered and documented by this project. No source
code was copied; only the protocol knowledge was used to implement
SpacePilotLcd.cs independently in C#.

## AerionInput / Aerion SpaceNav Win32 Driver (LGPL 2.1)
License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1
The original HID communication layer and COM-bridge research was derived from
the AerionInput project by Christian Bayer (2008, Friedrich-Schiller
University of Jena / Bauhaus University of Weimar), as credited in
OpenNDOF.App/Views/AboutView.xaml. The Win32 HID enumeration and
report-reading approach in OpenNDOF.HID (SetupDi device enumeration,
HidD_* attribute queries, ReadFile input loop, DeviceIoControl feature
reports) was informed by this driver.

